{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27395","headline":"关试後嘉会里闻蝉感怀呈主司 · 顾非熊","name":"关试後嘉会里闻蝉感怀呈主司","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔闻惊节换，常抱异乡愁。\n今听当命遂，方欢上国游。\n吟才依树午，风已报庭秋。\n并觉声声好，怀恩忽泪流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾非熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}